    "note": "The icons the ROM draws: its `--range` list (0xE55B, 0xF1E6, 0xF1EB, 0xF240-0xF244) are FontAwesome 6 codepoints (plug-circle-bolt, plug, wifi, battery-full..empty). 0xF078 (LV_SYMBOL_DOWN, the dropdown chevron the owner reported as a missing glyph in issue #9) is added here: it is the same icon set, and only the Sony family carried an icon range before."
  },
